{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽教大家製作蒲瓜煎餅。這道夏日小食外層煎至香脆，內裡的瓜則非常爽口，並配上鹹香的小魷魚與蝦米，惹味又好吃。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"db109f03-b35b-4d35-8050-6d5fbf4cceb8.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026FIG28EC1GY1788257544.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"db109f03-b35b-4d35-8050-6d5fbf4cceb8.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒲瓜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹹小魷魚（需剁碎）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蝦米</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅蘿蔔（切絲）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麵粉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雞蛋</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">胡椒粉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鹽</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e658ab08-4991-4e2c-84de-33c6c174ad91.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026rLfjWe2MW51788257544.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e658ab08-4991-4e2c-84de-33c6c174ad91.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T10:19:39.657896+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}